{
    "title": "Real Piano For Pianists",
    "description": "\"<b>Real Piano For Pianists</b>\" is an electric keyboard simulator app with virtual musical instruments to help you learn chords and music notes for free! Learn how to play the piano keys in many interesting ways! \r\n3D Pianos Keyboard work well on both phone and tablets.It rearranges the audio with the ADSR filter that gives the user high quality sound. You can zoom in or out to see the full keyboard\r\n\ud83c\udfb9 Full 88 key keyboard\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Free popular and classic songs\r\n\u2605 Single-row mode; Double-row mode; Dual players; Chords mode\r\n\u2605 Multitouch screen support.\r\n\u2605 Connect your own digital piano and play along.\r\n\u2605 You can record while playing the piano to MIDI file format. You can set the size of the piano with the plus and minus keys.\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Force touch\r\n\u2605 Keyboard width adjustment\r\n\ud83c\udfb6 128 Different keyboards and various instruments: Basic keyboard, Grand Piano, Organ, Harpsichord, Accordion,....\r\n\u2605 Multiple in-built sound effects: Grand piano, Bright Piano, Music Box, Pipe Organ, Rhodes, Synthesiser\r\n\ud83c\udfb6 MIDI and ACC audio recording\r\n\u2605 Learn to play your favourite songs on the piano by playing back the piano keyboard.\r\n\u2605 Metronome \r\n\"<b>Real Piano For Pianists</b>\" is An awesome tool for discovering the power of music.",
    "descriptionHTML": "&quot;<b>Real Piano For Pianists</b>&quot; is an electric keyboard simulator app with virtual musical instruments to help you learn chords and music notes for free! Learn how to play the piano keys in many interesting ways! <br>3D Pianos Keyboard work well on both phone and tablets.It rearranges the audio with the ADSR filter that gives the user high quality sound. You can zoom in or out to see the full keyboard<br>\ud83c\udfb9 Full 88 key keyboard<br>\ud83c\udfb5 Free popular and classic songs<br>\u2605 Single-row mode; Double-row mode; Dual players; Chords mode<br>\u2605 Multitouch screen support.<br>\u2605 Connect your own digital piano and play along.<br>\u2605 You can record while playing the piano to MIDI file format. You can set the size of the piano with the plus and minus keys.<br>\ud83c\udfb5 Force touch<br>\u2605 Keyboard width adjustment<br>\ud83c\udfb6 128 Different keyboards and various instruments: Basic keyboard, Grand Piano, Organ, Harpsichord, Accordion,....<br>\u2605 Multiple in-built sound effects: Grand piano, Bright Piano, Music Box, Pipe Organ, Rhodes, Synthesiser<br>\ud83c\udfb6 MIDI and ACC audio recording<br>\u2605 Learn to play your favourite songs on the piano by playing back the piano keyboard.<br>\u2605 Metronome <br>&quot;<b>Real Piano For Pianists</b>&quot; is An awesome tool for discovering the power of music.",
